  m_Text: 'Steps to do the recharge into your wallet


    1. Scan the QR code and
    pay directly using PhonePE or Gpay or Paytm or any other UPI payment app.


    2.
    Take Screenshot of the payment and send via whatsapp


    3. Wait for 5 to 10
    minutes to get the new balance reflected in your wallet.

'
